WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:03.620
How does a real-world
asset become a token?

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:06.760
Let's follow one asset, step by step.

00:00:07.108 --> 00:00:09.468
Meet an Australian farmland fund.

00:00:09.638 --> 00:00:10.538
Investors hold its units,

00:00:10.618 --> 00:00:15.048
and the register sits across separate
systems, updated after the fact.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.630
Tokenisation records that
ownership as digital tokens,

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:20.620
with the fund's rules programmed in.

00:00:20.829 --> 00:00:23.779
The manager uses Tokeniser,
a familiar platform.

00:00:23.859 --> 00:00:25.899
Underneath runs Redbelly Network,

00:00:25.979 --> 00:00:28.489
Australia's public digital
token infrastructure.

00:00:29.017 --> 00:00:30.627
Step one: set up.

00:00:30.707 --> 00:00:33.227
The fund is verified, and its rules,

00:00:33.307 --> 00:00:36.677
like wholesale investors only,
are encoded into the token.

00:00:37.031 --> 00:00:38.691
Step two: investors.

00:00:38.841 --> 00:00:40.541
Each is verified through Averer,

00:00:40.621 --> 00:00:43.931
then gets a wallet on
Redbelly Network to hold tokens.

00:00:44.336 --> 00:00:45.816
Step three: issue.

00:00:46.126 --> 00:00:49.086
Tokens are minted on Redbelly Network
into verified wallets,

00:00:49.166 --> 00:00:50.896
and the register updates immediately.

00:00:51.302 --> 00:00:52.912
Step four: transfer.

00:00:52.992 --> 00:00:56.000
Every transfer is checked
against the rules first.

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:59.489
A transfer to an ineligible
investor is rejected.

00:00:59.569 --> 00:01:02.569
A compliant one settles
on Redbelly in seconds.

00:01:02.899 --> 00:01:07.229
When investors hold their own wallets,
transfer and payment complete together.

00:01:07.539 --> 00:01:09.649
Once confirmed, it is final.

00:01:09.978 --> 00:01:12.848
Every check, transfer and
rejection is recorded,

00:01:12.928 --> 00:01:15.178
ready for auditors and regulators.

00:01:15.594 --> 00:01:17.704
Same farmland, same fund.

00:01:17.784 --> 00:01:20.604
Its units are now compliant
tokens on Redbelly Network,

00:01:20.684 --> 00:01:22.354
issued through Tokeniser.
